            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A bag contains an equal number of black and white marbles. Three marbles are drawn, with replacement. What is the probability of getting at most one black marble?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-p2-hint",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
